# This repo lives at ~/dotfiles, a directory only you write to — so a normal
# denylist is appropriate here.
#
# It used to be rooted at ~/.config and needed an allowlist, because CLI tools
# stash plaintext credentials there (gh/hosts.yml, gcloud/credentials.db,
# configstore/*.json). Moving the repo out removed that entire class of accident:
# those files are no longer inside the repository at all, so there is no rule to
# get right. Keep it that way — don't move this repo back under ~/.config.

.DS_Store
*.log
*.swp
*.backup.*
